  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_1345.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado, 31 enero, se ha celebrado en Fanzara la fiesta de San Ant&oacute;n, con una amplio programa preparado por la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas, que inclu&iacute;a un taller infantil de caballitos, la actuaci&oacute;n del grupo de Onda De Calle o la presentaci&oacute;n oficial del nuevo escudo municipal, sin olvidar las tres vueltas a las dos hogueras a cargo de los m&aacute;s de 50 caballos participantes. Y la bendici&oacute;n de animales el reparto de rollos, claro. A medianoche, ha habido verbena.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/1012785_339987456192652_1410519897462198807_n.jpg\" alt=\"1012785_339987456192652_1410519897462198807_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/10313494_339985972859467_205988359087985672_n.jpg\" alt=\"10313494_339985972859467_205988359087985672_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/10404364_339986176192780_4799581546655758019_n.jpg\" alt=\"10404364_339986176192780_4799581546655758019_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/10406981_339986042859460_4028373705905398814_n.jpg\" alt=\"10406981_339986042859460_4028373705905398814_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/10421985_339987459525985_1896045976676925143_n.jpg\" alt=\"10421985_339987459525985_1896045976676925143_n\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonfanzara15/104268